    "created_at": "2026-04-15T20:18:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-15T20:18:32Z",
    "body": "A non-global alternative would be to keep invalidation state on the store objects instead of in globalThis. However this complicates the code and is likely somewhat larger. The computed needs to keep references to it's dependencies and then generate an \"epoch\" value from the individual stores.\n\nUltimately it's probably not worth it, but I felt it was worth mentioning.",
